    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aecd6bfd0e1a2.15013347\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Play WoW: Forever for 15 minutes and earn 700 Discord Orbs!<br><br>A new Discord Quest asks players to play WoW: Forever for 15 minutes to earn 700 Discord Orbs (840 with Nitro). You can find this quest by going to Direct Messages &gt; Quests &gt; World of Warcraft Play Quest. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Discord Quest\" width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56021.png?maxWidth=400\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.2658227848101267\"></div><br><br>Once you accept the quest, play the game for 15 minutes and then claim your Orbs! Discord Orbs can be used to purchase cosmetics from the Discord shop.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Play WoW: Forever for 15 minutes and earn 700 Discord Orbs!<br /><br />A new Discord Quest asks players to play WoW: Forever for 15 minutes to earn 700 Discord Orbs (840 with Nitro). You can find this quest by going to Direct Messages &gt; Quests &gt; World of Warcraft Play Quest. <br /><br />Once you accept the quest, play the game for 15 minutes and then claim your Orbs! Discord Orbs can be used to purchase cosmetics from the Discord shop.</noscript>            \n        ",
